AirZip uses the 7-Zip engine (7z.dll) for archive extraction.

7-Zip is Copyright (C) 1999-2024 Igor Pavlov and is licensed under the GNU LGPL,
with an additional restriction that the RAR decompression code may not be used
to develop a RAR (or WinRAR) compressor. Full text: https://www.7-zip.org/license.txt

Per the LGPL, 7z.dll is used here as an unmodified, dynamically linked library
loaded from AirZip's own installation folder, and you may replace it with a
compatible version of your choosing.
